Package: CellFilter
Type: Package
Title: Takes a matrix, orders cells by decreasing library size and keeps only the first n cells
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Maria Corinna", "Diener",
      email = "maria.diener@edu.unito.it",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Reads the count matrix from input_file, with genes on rows and cells on columns
    Computes, for each cell, the total number of counts across all genes (the library size)
    Orders the cells by decreasing library size and keeps only the first n cells. The gene rows and their
order must remain unchanged.
    Saves the filtered matrix to output_file as CSV, preserving the gene identifiers and the column
names of the retained cells.
    Returns a named list with n_cells_kept and the dimensions of the filtered matrix as n_genes and
n_cells.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
